{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James, been a few days since we chatted. Lots of stuff goin' on in my life!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-d5198f26bd2803fedd8a142e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.282626+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d5198f26bd2803fedd8a142e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d5198f26bd2803fedd8a142e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! What new has happened in your life?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-0015483fa79cd8c95b685135", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.315936+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0015483fa79cd8c95b685135", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0015483fa79cd8c95b685135", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yesterday I started a new startup - portable smokers. Now, I\u2019ve already welded one from metal. Do you think it looks good? How about you, any cool stuff happening?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-66f79ee2bb5639c61993d215", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.343932+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66f79ee2bb5639c61993d215", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66f79ee2bb5639c61993d215", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John, that looks great! Seeing it makes me think of campfires with pals. Last night I streamed a game and wow, was I blown away by all the nice comments from the gaming community. I felt so stoked and inspired to keep going."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-6cff65639dfa4df403ce5147", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.378797+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6cff65639dfa4df403ce5147", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6cff65639dfa4df403ce5147", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Woohoo, congrats James! That's awesome. Sounds like you're doing well. All your hard work is paying off, so keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-1146ffca9fe0ebb8846b6514", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.417271+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1146ffca9fe0ebb8846b6514", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1146ffca9fe0ebb8846b6514", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks for the support, John! This made me think of such an exciting time. Any more big moments recently?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-d7c3a15016bc20fcdcf79e5c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.448094+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d7c3a15016bc20fcdcf79e5c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d7c3a15016bc20fcdcf79e5c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I just achieved a major career milestone - making my first mobile game! It's launching next month."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-950df34c8e58654f38e68819", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.471108+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "950df34c8e58654f38e68819", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "950df34c8e58654f38e68819", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Way to go, John! Congrats on achieving that major career milestone. Could you tell me more about it? Why didn\u2019t you say before that you were creating a mobile game?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-438510d6a2104dc0cb94d0c6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.498275+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "438510d6a2104dc0cb94d0c6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "438510d6a2104dc0cb94d0c6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks James! I kept it a secret because I would have been very upset if I had told you about her in advance and then it wouldn't have worked out. I've been working on this for the past few months and I'm really proud of how it's turned out. It's a 2D adventure game with puzzles and exploration. Here's a screenshot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-9ffa7ba9227371bb611bbed0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.525611+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9ffa7ba9227371bb611bbed0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9ffa7ba9227371bb611bbed0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: John, this sounds great! I'm into 2D adventures with puzzles - like The Legend of Zelda. Can I see it or help with testing it out?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-9e200bdeae107464301584ad", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.569141+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9e200bdeae107464301584ad", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9e200bdeae107464301584ad", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cheers, James! Appreciate your offer to help. I'll definitely let you know when the testing is ready. By the way, here is the book that helped me create the puzzles for this game."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-9e3ce94e6336bf594de08048", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.596809+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9e3ce94e6336bf594de08048", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9e3ce94e6336bf594de08048", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, that book looks great! What other resources do you use to improve your game? Tell me about your gaming tips!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-d06d83cb788b359596b497fc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.636061+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d06d83cb788b359596b497fc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d06d83cb788b359596b497fc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It is filled with awesome tips and insights on game design. I also watch tutorials and keep up with developer forums for information and ideas. Basically, staying informed and constantly learning is key!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-c5c588d772e73cda9069b5a4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.664861+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c5c588d772e73cda9069b5a4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c5c588d772e73cda9069b5a4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: You're really dedicated to improving and staying up to date. It's inspiring to see how you stay informed and keep learning. I also advise you to read this magazine, which is also a worthy source of information. Keep up the good work!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-71a0652cdaffa4c0f9d5d942", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.701529+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "71a0652cdaffa4c0f9d5d942", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "71a0652cdaffa4c0f9d5d942", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I read it, too. This magazine has been great for me too. Tutorials, interviews with developers, and tips - all really helpful."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-a7276c92e7a38e5a127fdb4a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.743526+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a7276c92e7a38e5a127fdb4a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a7276c92e7a38e5a127fdb4a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, John! Glad that resource was useful - looks like it provides some good tips and tricks for game developers."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-2d4e0ad2ac8b1c46df3694e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.769085+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d4e0ad2ac8b1c46df3694e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d4e0ad2ac8b1c46df3694e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, that magazine looks great! Have you also found it to be a good resource?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-66fed814f7f2dc8bbb136755", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.797595+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66fed814f7f2dc8bbb136755", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66fed814f7f2dc8bbb136755", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Of course! It's been great, filled with tutorials and developer interviews to help improve my game dev skills. Super useful!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-3082ab9d540de9fef9e06c6b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.825699+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3082ab9d540de9fef9e06c6b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3082ab9d540de9fef9e06c6b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Resources like that are great for improving our skills. Keep it up! How's your week been?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-df1ae3957997b9609c6a8e67", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.881093+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "df1ae3957997b9609c6a8e67", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "df1ae3957997b9609c6a8e67", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: My week's been good. Just trying to find a balance between work and other activities. How about you, how's your week going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-bab03c281f27b0d43a05ca28", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.912896+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bab03c281f27b0d43a05ca28", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bab03c281f27b0d43a05ca28", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: As for me, this week has been chaotic with everything going on. But I'm powering through!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-28bf985d48e60d1969a456d7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.940622+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "28bf985d48e60d1969a456d7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "28bf985d48e60d1969a456d7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sorry to hear about your busy week, John. Make sure to take some time for yourself and take care. You've got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-71a26af0b397002b3a328a1e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.966445+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "71a26af0b397002b3a328a1e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "71a26af0b397002b3a328a1e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I appreciate your help. Gonna make time for myself."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-a0f1c9c597fa046b95d5184e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:12.993746+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a0f1c9c597fa046b95d5184e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a0f1c9c597fa046b95d5184e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: No worries, take care of yourself. Relax and recharge - you deserve it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-3a71004098e48f5482d4e63c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:13.011566+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3a71004098e48f5482d4e63c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3a71004098e48f5482d4e63c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, man! I'll definitely take your advice. You're the best!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_25-98460cd77c001e9173ca2438", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:23:13.034696+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "98460cd77c001e9173ca2438", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "98460cd77c001e9173ca2438", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
